                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of rain, most likely during this afternoon and evening. The chance of a thunderstorm from late this morning. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h turning southerly 20 to 30 km/h in the early afternoon. Daytime maximum temperatures around 20.</text>
